          "default": {},
          "scope": "window",
          "markdownDescription": "Legacy per-stage AI model IDs, superseded by `#ensemble.modelSettings#`. Bare IDs are GitHub Copilot models; prefixed IDs (e.g. `claude-cli:sonnet`, `codex-cli:default`, `gemini-cli:gemini-2.5-pro`, `antigravity-cli:default`, `kiro-cli:default`) run through the vendor's subscription CLI. Configure via **Ensemble: Configure AI Models per Step**.",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "string"
          }
